WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.434
-Welcome back. We're hanging out
with Miles Teller!

00:00:03.434 --> 00:00:05.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.267
He is hosting "Saturday
Night Live" this weekend,

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:11.167
but first we're about to
face off in a game of Drinko.

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:13.567
Drinko, do you want to explain
how the game works?

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:16.968
-Yes. Welcome to Drinko.
In this game, the two of you

00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:18.467
will take turns
climbing my stairs

00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:21.701
and dropping two of your disks
down the Drinko board.

00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:24.300
The disks will plink down
and land in these plastic cups

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.901
containing some of my favorite
beverages such as...

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:28.634
Girl Scout Thin Mints,

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:32.100
cream-cheese water,
and garlic shot.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.267
Your opponent
must drink the cocktail

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.033
of the two chosen drinks.

00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:38.400
-Alright. Thank you very much.
-Cheese water?

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.868
-Drinko, what did you say again?
Did you say --

00:00:40.868 --> 00:00:43.334
-Cream-cheese water!
-Alright.

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:45.567
-♪ It's water
with cream cheese! ♪

00:00:45.567 --> 00:00:47.367
-That's my favorite --

00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:49.234
That's a great
Harry styles song.

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:52.234
♪ Cream-cheese water, ah,
cream-cheese water ♪

00:00:52.234 --> 00:00:54.067
Alright, Miles,
why don't you go up there first

00:00:54.067 --> 00:00:55.834
because you're our guest?
-Sure.

00:00:55.834 --> 00:00:57.400
-Climb up the steps of Drinko
and enjoy yourself

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.934
a good beverage.
-Yes. Thank you.

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:00.200
-Yeah, no problem.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:01.734 --> 00:01:03.100
-Drinko, you okay?

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:06.033
-Drop the disk whenever
you're ready, Miles.

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:09.167
-Alright.
-Here it comes.

00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:12.100
Cream-cheese water!

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:14.234
-Alright. Your first cup
will be the garlic shot.

00:01:14.234 --> 00:01:16.701
-Garlic shot!
-[ Sad tuba plays ]

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:18.701
-It's a garlic shot.
-That's healthy.

00:01:18.701 --> 00:01:20.534
-That's healthy for you.
That's not that bad.

00:01:20.534 --> 00:01:22.634
And then you're gonna mix that
with another beverage

00:01:22.634 --> 00:01:24.267
once you drop the second chip.

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:26.868
-Drop your second disks.

00:01:26.868 --> 00:01:29.000
Here it comes.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.133
Coming down the stairway.

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:34.067
Ginger kombucha.
-Ooh. Not bad actually.

00:01:34.067 --> 00:01:35.868
-Ginger kombucha.

00:01:35.868 --> 00:01:38.567
-Oh, my -- I'm -- This is great.

00:01:38.567 --> 00:01:41.400
-Miles, you have
ginger kombucha...

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.901
Thank you, Drinko.

00:01:42.901 --> 00:01:44.367
-I think they sell these --
-You wanna take those?

00:01:44.367 --> 00:01:46.868
-You can buy this shot in a
store right now for like $14.

00:01:46.868 --> 00:01:48.200
-Yeah, that's actually not bad.

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:50.634
You've got ginger kombucha
and garlic shot.

00:01:50.634 --> 00:01:52.200
Not bad.
-Ooh.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:55.667
-Place it in this nice cup
right there and enjoy yourself.

00:01:55.667 --> 00:01:58.067
A garlic shot.

00:01:58.067 --> 00:02:00.167
[ Audience groans ]

00:02:00.167 --> 00:02:03.000
-Mmm!
-Alright.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.767
♪♪

00:02:05.767 --> 00:02:07.434
Good luck. Good to see you.

00:02:07.434 --> 00:02:08.901
-Oh!

00:02:08.901 --> 00:02:11.834
-Oh, that'll help.
That'll help.

00:02:11.834 --> 00:02:13.734
-God, it's --

00:02:13.734 --> 00:02:16.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.567
♪♪

00:02:17.567 --> 00:02:22.067
-Ahh. I feel lighter.
I don't know. I feel --

00:02:22.067 --> 00:02:24.000
I'm so much healthier
than you right now.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.567
-Your Adam's apple was shaking
as you were drinking.

00:02:26.567 --> 00:02:28.868
[ Gurgling ]

00:02:28.868 --> 00:02:32.033
-Yeah.
-Now it is your turn, James.

00:02:32.033 --> 00:02:34.067
-What do you want me to do,
Drinko?

00:02:34.067 --> 00:02:36.601
-I want you
to ascend the staircase

00:02:36.601 --> 00:02:39.033
and drop two disks in me.
-Okay.

00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:41.033
-Drinko's getting
a little bossy.

00:02:41.033 --> 00:02:43.200
-Drinko.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:45.467
-I'm sorry. On me. All over me.

00:02:45.467 --> 00:02:47.067
-Alright, all right.

00:02:47.067 --> 00:02:49.701
-Climb the -- Unh! Eh! Ah!

00:02:49.701 --> 00:02:55.133
Unh! Eee! Ooh! Ooh! Ohh...

00:02:55.133 --> 00:02:57.067
Drop the disk, baby.

00:02:57.067 --> 00:02:59.234
♪♪

00:02:59.234 --> 00:03:01.501
-Alright. I want to stay away
from cream-cheese water.

00:03:01.501 --> 00:03:03.400
-No.
-I'm going to throw up

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:06.200
if I do cream-cheese water.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.200
Is that good right here?

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.767
-Here we go.

00:03:09.767 --> 00:03:12.367
-No! Stay away from that side!
Yes! Good, good, good.

00:03:12.367 --> 00:03:14.167
Oh, no, oh, no!

00:03:14.167 --> 00:03:16.267
-No! Yoo-hoo!

00:03:16.267 --> 00:03:18.868
-Yoo-hoo! Yes!

00:03:18.868 --> 00:03:20.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:20.734 --> 00:03:22.234
-Drop the second disk.

00:03:22.234 --> 00:03:25.133
-Ugh. Let's just do it.
Alright. Here we go.

00:03:25.133 --> 00:03:27.234
-Come on, cream-cheese water!

00:03:27.234 --> 00:03:28.667
[ Drinko grunting ]

00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:31.167
-No, no, no. Please.
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:03:31.167 --> 00:03:33.300
-Hey!

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:35.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:35.167 --> 00:03:42.200
♪♪

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.601
Oh, James.

00:03:44.601 --> 00:03:48.467
You must drink
my cream-cheese water.

00:03:48.467 --> 00:03:51.868
-I hate this game. I --

00:03:51.868 --> 00:03:53.834
I just -- It's not.
-That's the cream --

00:03:53.834 --> 00:03:55.534
-It is not!

00:03:55.534 --> 00:03:57.300
♪♪

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.167
Why in the world?!

00:03:59.167 --> 00:04:04.300
-♪ Cream-cheese water ♪

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.534
Two drinks, one cup.

00:04:06.534 --> 00:04:08.634
[ Audience groans ]
There you go.

00:04:08.634 --> 00:04:10.467
♪♪

00:04:10.467 --> 00:04:12.501
-Ugh!
-Cream-cheese water.

00:04:12.501 --> 00:04:14.968
[ Laughter ]

00:04:14.968 --> 00:04:17.133
-I mean, it might pair well
with Yoo-hoo.

00:04:17.133 --> 00:04:19.167
-You can do it, James.
You can do it.

00:04:19.167 --> 00:04:20.901
Oh, that's the Yoo-hoo.

00:04:20.901 --> 00:04:27.100
♪♪

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:30.701
-[ Groans ] I really --
This type of stuff. I can't --

00:04:30.701 --> 00:04:33.267
I can't do it. I can't.
Like --

00:04:33.267 --> 00:04:36.234
-You can do it. You can do it.

00:04:36.234 --> 00:04:37.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:38.701
-[ Coughs ]

00:04:38.701 --> 00:04:41.367
♪♪

00:04:41.367 --> 00:04:43.300
[ Coughs ]

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:46.968
♪♪

00:04:46.968 --> 00:04:48.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:48.701 --> 00:04:51.467
♪♪

00:04:51.467 --> 00:04:53.200
-Wow!

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:56.868
♪♪

00:04:56.868 --> 00:04:58.534
Ohh!

00:04:58.534 --> 00:05:00.434
-How's that?
-Not so bad.

00:05:00.434 --> 00:05:02.300
-It's so gross.
-Yeah.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.701
-It's so --
What's the worst part is,

00:05:03.701 --> 00:05:05.667
it's still in the beard.

00:05:05.667 --> 00:05:08.033
[ Laughter ]
It is so gross.

00:05:08.033 --> 00:05:10.067
Gosh, that is disgusting.
Okay.

00:05:10.067 --> 00:05:11.300
-Cream-cheese water.

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:13.200
Are you ready
for the final round?

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:16.367
-Yeah. Okay.
This is gonna be a race.

00:05:16.367 --> 00:05:19.200
We're both gonna climb up
there. It's not over now?

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:22.033
-No, one more round.
-What's the final round?

00:05:22.033 --> 00:05:24.267
-Both of you climb up
and drop a disk.

00:05:24.267 --> 00:05:26.667
Whosever first disk lands first
is the winner,

00:05:26.667 --> 00:05:30.634
and the loser has to drink
the cocktail of both beverages.

00:05:30.634 --> 00:05:32.467
♪ Let's go ♪

00:05:32.467 --> 00:05:34.634
♪♪

00:05:34.634 --> 00:05:36.200
-Oh. Wait. What is it?

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.467
-Both of you
climb up the stairs.

00:05:38.467 --> 00:05:40.868
-Alright.
-Both of you drop a disk.

00:05:40.868 --> 00:05:43.567
-We're dropping two disks?
-Yes, at the same time.

00:05:43.567 --> 00:05:46.734
Whoever's disk gets there
first wins.

00:05:46.734 --> 00:05:51.601
The other person has to drink
the drink, the loser's drink.

00:05:51.601 --> 00:05:54.701
-I think the Drinko guy
is drunk. I don't think --

00:05:54.701 --> 00:05:56.634
-Oh, yeah.
-That's why they call me Drinko.

00:05:56.634 --> 00:05:58.133
[ Laughter ]

00:05:58.133 --> 00:06:01.934
-Drinko, wait.
Where do we find you, Drinko?

00:06:01.934 --> 00:06:04.167
-Ready?
I'm going to count to three.

00:06:04.167 --> 00:06:06.200
-Drinko, where did we find you?

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.834
-You didn't find me.
I found you.

00:06:07.834 --> 00:06:09.767
[ Laughter ]

00:06:09.767 --> 00:06:12.167
-Alright.
So we're both dropping --

00:06:12.167 --> 00:06:13.968
We're both dropping
at the same time.

00:06:13.968 --> 00:06:16.267
-At the same time. I will
count down, "3, 2, 1, drop."

00:06:16.267 --> 00:06:17.400
Are you ready?
-Yes.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:19.000
Where are you putting yours?
On the line?

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:20.734
-Right here.
-Okay.

00:06:20.734 --> 00:06:24.334
-3, 2, 1, drop.

00:06:24.334 --> 00:06:27.133
♪♪

00:06:27.133 --> 00:06:29.167
-Oh, I'm toast.
-Yo!

00:06:29.167 --> 00:06:31.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:31.067 --> 00:06:32.267
-What'd you get?

00:06:32.267 --> 00:06:33.701
What did we get?
What did we get?

00:06:33.701 --> 00:06:35.968
Is it more cream-cheese water!

00:06:35.968 --> 00:06:37.767
This is the best game ever!

00:06:37.767 --> 00:06:40.667
Drinko, Drinko, Drinko!
Drinko, Drinko, Drinko!

00:06:40.667 --> 00:06:43.067
What did we get?
Yoo-hoo...

00:06:43.067 --> 00:06:44.701
-Well, I think I've got the...

00:06:44.701 --> 00:06:46.267
-And the garlic shot again?
Dude.

00:06:46.267 --> 00:06:48.767
-Oh, garlic shot.
-What do you -- What do you --

00:06:48.767 --> 00:06:50.801
I'll give you -- You can add
one more thing to mine.

00:06:50.801 --> 00:06:52.801
-Okay.
-Bone broth.

00:06:52.801 --> 00:06:54.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:54.634 --> 00:06:57.634
[ Audience
shouting suggestions ]

00:06:57.634 --> 00:06:59.467
-Mustard juice.

00:06:59.467 --> 00:07:03.434
♪♪

00:07:03.434 --> 00:07:06.200
Cream-cheese water.
-No.

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:09.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:09.667 --> 00:07:11.901
They -- The audience
turned on me so fast.

00:07:11.901 --> 00:07:13.234
It's like...

00:07:13.234 --> 00:07:14.834
-They loved you
when you come out.

00:07:14.834 --> 00:07:16.367
-I come out. They're like,
"Oh, 'Top Gun," this and that."

00:07:16.367 --> 00:07:18.334
For this, they're like...
-"Cream-cheese water."

00:07:18.334 --> 00:07:20.701
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
-You guys are mean.

00:07:20.701 --> 00:07:22.734
-Good luck. Are you -- Do you
have a good, strong stomach?

00:07:22.734 --> 00:07:27.033
-No. I do have, like, a fairly
sensitive gag reflex.

00:07:27.033 --> 00:07:29.534
-I can't think about what I did.
The Yoo-hoo helped me.

00:07:29.601 --> 00:07:32.234
The Yoo-hoo helped me.

00:07:32.234 --> 00:07:35.434
That's not Yoo-hoo.
That's garlic.

00:07:35.434 --> 00:07:37.667
And that's the Yoo-hoo.
-Here comes the Yoo-hoo.

00:07:37.667 --> 00:07:42.501
-I'm gonna add a little
cranberry into this one.

00:07:42.501 --> 00:07:44.701
-Oh, my God.
-Take it to the "finish."

00:07:44.701 --> 00:07:47.434
-That's a lot to chug.
-Turn and burn, baby.

00:07:47.434 --> 00:07:51.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:51.033 --> 00:07:52.734
-Oh, my God! Legend!

00:07:52.734 --> 00:07:55.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:59.000
♪♪

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:02.534
Legend right there!
Miles Teller!

00:08:02.534 --> 00:08:05.133
How did you do that?
How did you do that?

